WEBVTT

00:08.620 --> 00:09.655
Are you ready, kids?
孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:09.758 --> 00:11.379
Aye, aye, Captain!
是啊是啊，队长！

00:11.482 --> 00:12.620
I can't hear you.
我听不到你说话。

00:12.724 --> 00:15.172
Aye, aye, Captain!
是啊是啊，队长！

00:15.275 --> 00:17.344
♪ Oh...
♪ 哦...

00:17.448 --> 00:19.689
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:19.793 --> 00:21.413
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants! ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝！ ♪

00:21.517 --> 00:24.000
♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he. ♪
♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的。 ♪

00:24.103 --> 00:25.413
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants! ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝！ ♪

00:25.517 --> 00:27.793
♪ If nautical nonsense be
something you wish... ♪
♪ 如果航海方面的废话是
你想要的东西...♪

00:27.896 --> 00:29.241
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants! ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝！ ♪

00:29.344 --> 00:31.827
♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish. ♪
♪ 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通。 ♪

00:31.931 --> 00:33.620
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants! ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝！ ♪

00:33.724 --> 00:35.689
♪ Ready?
SpongeBob SquarePants! ♪
♪ 准备好了吗？
海绵宝宝！ ♪

00:35.793 --> 00:38.689
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants!
♪ 海绵宝宝！

00:38.793 --> 00:39.689
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants!
♪ 海绵宝宝！

00:39.793 --> 00:42.241
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants!
♪ 海绵宝宝！

00:44.620 --> 00:48.862
Captioning sponsored by THE
U.S. DEPARTMENT OF EDUCATION
字幕由 THE 赞助
美国教育部

00:48.965 --> 00:49.517
and NICKELODEON
和尼克国际儿童频道

00:49.620 --> 00:50.758
and NICKELODEON
和尼克国际儿童频道

01:01.448 --> 01:03.379
Ah, the Krusty Krab.
啊，蟹堡王。

01:03.482 --> 01:07.965
Through these doors pass all
the many kinds of undersea life.
通过这些门，所有的
多种海底生物。

01:08.068 --> 01:10.758
Through the double doors!
穿过双门！

01:10.862 --> 01:12.241
Away!
离开！

01:12.344 --> 01:13.965
Also these guys.
还有这些家伙。

01:14.068 --> 01:18.103
I told you I'm not
hungry, Mermaidman.
我告诉过你我不是
饿了，美人鱼。

01:18.206 --> 01:19.827
Nonsense, Barnacleboy.
胡说八道，藤壶男孩。

01:19.931 --> 01:23.275
We've got to keep up
our strength
我们必须跟上
我们的力量

01:23.379 --> 01:26.482
for the fight against evil!
为了对抗邪恶！

01:26.586 --> 01:27.896
What a dive.
真是一次潜水。

01:28.000 --> 01:29.827
To the register!
到登记处！

01:29.931 --> 01:31.068
Away!
离开！

01:31.172 --> 01:32.379
Can I help you?
我可以帮你吗？

01:32.482 --> 01:36.068
A double Krabby Patty
and coral bits for me
双层蟹肉饼
和我的珊瑚碎片

01:36.172 --> 01:38.310
and a Silly Meal for the lad.
还为这小伙子准备了一顿傻饭。

01:38.413 --> 01:40.896
Uh, it's not for the toy,
I just, uh...
呃，这不是为了玩具，
我只是，呃...

01:41.000 --> 01:43.758
I gotta fit
in the tights, you know?
我必须适应
穿紧身衣，你知道吗？

01:43.862 --> 01:45.379
Whatever.
任何。

01:45.482 --> 01:46.655
Five dollars, please.
请五美元。

01:46.758 --> 01:49.137
You got it, Bucky.
你明白了，巴基。

01:50.482 --> 01:52.586
Will this cover it?
这个会覆盖吗？

01:54.172 --> 01:54.896
No.
不。

01:55.000 --> 01:56.000
Listen, Big Nose.
听着，大鼻子。

01:56.034 --> 01:57.482
That guy's been saving your butt
那家伙一直在拯救你的屁股

01:57.586 --> 01:58.827
since before you were born.
从你出生之前开始。

01:58.931 --> 02:01.551
Don't you got
a Living Legend
discount or something?
难道你没有
活着的传奇
折扣什么的？

02:01.655 --> 02:04.862
This is a restaurant,
not a lending library.
这是一家餐厅，
不是借阅图书馆。

02:04.965 --> 02:07.724
And who're you calling
Big Nose, Big Nose?
你在给谁打电话
大鼻子，大鼻子？

02:07.827 --> 02:08.724
Hmm.
唔。

02:08.827 --> 02:09.586
Hmm.
唔。

02:09.689 --> 02:10.689
Hmm.
Hmm.
唔。
唔。

02:10.724 --> 02:12.275
Mm-hmm.
Hmm.
嗯嗯。
唔。

02:12.379 --> 02:13.448
Hmm.
Hmm.
唔。
唔。

02:13.551 --> 02:14.448
Hmm.
Hmm.
唔。
唔。

02:14.551 --> 02:15.896
The next time danger threatens,
下次当危险来临的时候，

02:16.000 --> 02:17.965
don't expect any help from us.
不要指望我们提供任何帮助。

02:18.068 --> 02:20.068
I'm shaking.
我在发抖。

02:20.172 --> 02:24.655
Hmm... Mermaidman
and Barnacleboy.
嗯……美人鱼
和藤壶男孩。

02:27.310 --> 02:29.068
Mermaidman and Barnacleboy!
美人鱼和藤壶男孩！

02:29.172 --> 02:31.862
Must... get...
autograph!
必须……得到……
签名！

02:31.965 --> 02:33.206
Ha!
哈!

02:35.517 --> 02:36.965
Yah!
啊！

02:37.655 --> 02:41.000
If you want to grow up
strong like me,
如果你想长大
像我一样坚强

02:41.103 --> 02:43.689
you gotta make room for seconds.
你得腾出几秒钟的空间。

02:43.793 --> 02:44.896
Here comes our waiter.
我们的服务员来了。

02:45.000 --> 02:47.689
Auto... graph...!
自动...图表...！

02:47.793 --> 02:50.655
Holy sea cow,
it's that sponge kid.
圣海牛，
就是那个海绵宝宝。

02:50.758 --> 02:51.827
Quick lad!
快点小伙子！

02:51.931 --> 02:54.827
To the invisible boat mobile.
向隐形船移动。

02:54.931 --> 02:56.034
Away!
离开！

02:56.137 --> 02:58.310
Where'd we park?
我们把车停在哪里？

02:58.413 --> 02:59.413
Uh...
呃...

02:59.448 --> 03:01.034
Can I have your autograph?
我可以要你的签名吗？

03:01.137 --> 03:02.241
Can I have your...?
我可以要你的...吗？

03:02.344 --> 03:03.344
They're gone.
他们走了。

03:04.344 --> 03:06.689
Mermaidman's belt!
美人鱼腰带！

03:06.793 --> 03:07.896
Wait!
等待！

03:08.000 --> 03:10.862
We'll find it with
the invisible boat alarm!
我们会找到它
隐形船警报器！

03:14.206 --> 03:16.310
There she is!
她在那儿！

03:18.586 --> 03:19.655
Yeow!
哟！

03:19.758 --> 03:21.655
I told you we should've
got the automatic.
我告诉过你我们应该
拿到了自动的。

03:21.758 --> 03:23.137
Hey guys, wait up!
嘿伙计们，等等！

03:23.241 --> 03:29.034
I've got something for you.
我有东西给你。

03:29.137 --> 03:30.137
Floor it!
地板吧！

03:31.896 --> 03:33.586
You forgot your belt!
你忘记带腰带了！

03:33.689 --> 03:35.931
You forgot...
你忘了...

03:36.517 --> 03:39.413
Mermaidman's
secret utility belt.
美人鱼的
秘密实用腰带。

03:39.517 --> 03:41.758
The emblem of
submersible justice.
会徽
潜入正义。

03:41.862 --> 03:45.379
For 65 years, this belt
has helped prevent
65 年来，这条腰带
有助于防止

03:45.482 --> 03:47.103
the fall of nations.
国家的衰落。

03:47.206 --> 03:48.551
And pants.
还有裤子。

03:48.655 --> 03:52.344
I can't believe I'm actually
holding it in my hands.
我不敢相信我真的是
把它握在我手里。

03:52.448 --> 03:55.034
Well, I guess
I should return it.
嗯，我猜
我应该归还它。

03:56.827 --> 03:57.827
Or not.
或不。

03:58.827 --> 04:02.793
I could just hold on to it
until after work.
我可以坚持下去
直到下班后。

04:02.896 --> 04:07.655
All alone
with Mermaidman's belt.
独自一人
与美人鱼的腰带。

04:07.758 --> 04:09.413
I wonder what this button does.
我想知道这个按钮有什么作用。

04:14.241 --> 04:16.275
Whoa...
哇...

04:16.379 --> 04:19.275
The small ray.
小射线。

04:21.517 --> 04:22.655
Here's your shake, sir.
这是您的奶昔，先生。

04:29.758 --> 04:30.517
Hmm.
唔。

04:30.620 --> 04:33.965
There you go.
就这样吧。

04:34.068 --> 04:35.137
Come again, sir.
再来吧，先生。

04:35.241 --> 04:36.241
SpongeBob!
海绵宝宝！

04:36.310 --> 04:37.931
What's going on in here?
这里发生了什么事？

04:38.034 --> 04:39.310
Huh?
啊？

04:42.344 --> 04:44.310
Why is everything all tiny?
为什么一切都那么小？

04:44.413 --> 04:46.000
I don't know.
我不知道。

04:46.103 --> 04:47.206
What have you got?
你有什么？

04:47.310 --> 04:48.172
Nothing.
没有什么。

04:48.275 --> 04:49.275
No, really.
不，真的。

04:49.310 --> 04:50.137
Nothing!
没有什么！

04:50.241 --> 04:51.241
Let's see it!
让我们看看吧！

04:51.310 --> 04:52.310
No, no!
不，不！

04:53.034 --> 04:55.517
Is that Mermaidman's belt?
这是美人鱼的腰带吗？

04:55.620 --> 04:56.517
Yes.
是的。

04:56.620 --> 04:57.620
Wow!
哇！

04:57.655 --> 05:00.724
I can't believe
he'd lend it to you.
我不敢相信
他会把它借给你。

05:00.827 --> 05:01.827
Me, uh, either.
我，呃，也是。

05:04.241 --> 05:06.793
He didn't lend it
to you, did he?
他没借
对你来说，是吗？

05:06.896 --> 05:07.896
Please don't tell.
请不要告诉。

05:07.965 --> 05:09.689
You stoleit.
你偷了。

05:09.793 --> 05:11.172
Please don't tell!
请不要告诉！

05:11.275 --> 05:13.172
Oh, I'm telling.
哦，我告诉你。

05:13.275 --> 05:14.448
If Mermaidman finds out,
如果美人鱼发现了

05:14.551 --> 05:17.344
he'll kick me out
of his fan club for sure!
他会把我踢出去
当然是他的粉丝俱乐部！

05:17.448 --> 05:18.517
Please don't tell!
请不要告诉！

05:18.620 --> 05:19.310
Uh-oh!
呃-哦！

05:19.413 --> 05:20.551
There's the phone.
电话在那儿。

05:20.655 --> 05:21.310
Don't!
不！

05:21.413 --> 05:22.172
I'm walking
我正在走路

05:22.275 --> 05:23.379
towards the phone.
走向电话。

05:23.482 --> 05:24.137
No!
不！

05:24.241 --> 05:25.724
I'm getting closer
我越来越近了

05:25.827 --> 05:26.827
to the phone.
到电话。

05:26.862 --> 05:27.931
Don't!
不！

05:28.034 --> 05:29.827
And now for the moment
现在暂时

05:29.931 --> 05:32.517
we've all been waiting for.
我们都在等待。

05:32.620 --> 05:34.896
I'm begging you!
我求求你了！

05:35.000 --> 05:36.103
Hello.
你好。

05:36.206 --> 05:38.344
I'd like to speak to Mer...
我想和梅尔谈谈...

05:42.172 --> 05:43.482
What did... Ow!
做了什么……哎呀！

05:43.586 --> 05:44.793
Hello? Hello?
你好？你好？

05:44.896 --> 05:46.275
What did you do to me?!
你对我做了什么？！

05:46.379 --> 05:47.965
I'm sorry,
but you made me do it!
对不起，
但你让我这么做了！

05:48.068 --> 05:52.448
SpongeBob, if you don't return
me to normal size right now,
海绵宝宝，如果你不回来
我现在的尺寸是正常的

05:52.551 --> 05:53.689
you are going to be
你将会成为

05:53.793 --> 05:55.413
in really big trouble.
真的遇到大麻烦了。

05:55.517 --> 05:58.413
Uh... uh... okay.
呃……呃……好吧。

05:58.517 --> 05:59.931
I said now!
我说现在！

06:00.034 --> 06:01.103
Uh...
呃...

06:03.034 --> 06:04.655
Uh... uh...
呃……呃……

06:04.758 --> 06:05.517
Uh...
呃...

06:05.620 --> 06:06.689
Do you hear me?!
你听到我说话了吗？

06:08.379 --> 06:10.275
Holy fish paste!
圣鱼酱！

06:10.379 --> 06:11.655
Get it off me!
把它从我身上拿开！

06:11.758 --> 06:13.034
Get it off me!
把它从我身上拿开！

06:14.344 --> 06:16.655
Don't you know
how to work that thing?
你不知道吗
怎么做那个东西？

06:16.758 --> 06:18.448
Uh, I can do it!
嗯，我能做到！

06:38.586 --> 06:40.310
Stop!
停止！

06:40.413 --> 06:41.827
I've got an idea.
我有一个主意。

06:41.931 --> 06:44.206
Let's call Mermaidman and...
我们就叫美人鱼吧...

06:44.310 --> 06:45.034
No!
不！

06:45.137 --> 06:46.241
I can't let you do that!
我不能让你这么做！

06:46.344 --> 06:49.068
But there must be
someone else who
can help.
但一定有
其他人
可以提供帮助。

06:49.172 --> 06:50.310
Someone smart and wise
一个聪明又睿智的人

06:50.413 --> 06:52.586
with years of life experience.
凭借多年的生活经验。

06:52.689 --> 06:53.689
Patrick!
帕特里克！

06:54.793 --> 06:56.034
Patrick, Patrick!
帕特里克，帕特里克！

06:57.172 --> 06:58.172
Oh, hi, SpongeBob!
哦，嗨，海绵宝宝！

06:58.241 --> 06:59.241
I was at work
我当时在工作

06:59.275 --> 07:01.000
and Mermaidman
and Barnacleboy came,
和美人鱼
藤壶男孩来了，

07:01.103 --> 07:02.724
and I got this belt and look!
我拿到了这条腰带，看看！

07:02.827 --> 07:04.793
A Squidward action figure!
章鱼哥可动人偶！

07:04.896 --> 07:06.103
Let me play with him!
让我陪他玩吧！

07:06.206 --> 07:06.965
No, Patrick!
不，帕特里克！

07:07.068 --> 07:08.241
Fighter pilot!
战斗机飞行员！

07:13.724 --> 07:14.724
Dive bomb!
俯冲炸弹！

07:14.793 --> 07:15.482
Patrick!
帕特里克！

07:15.586 --> 07:16.827
And then a giant fist!
然后是一个巨大的拳头！

07:16.931 --> 07:17.758
Patrick, no!
帕特里克，不！

07:17.862 --> 07:19.275
That's not an action figure,
这不是一个动作人物，

07:19.379 --> 07:20.931
that's the real Squidward.
这才是真正的章鱼哥。

07:21.034 --> 07:22.896
I shrunk him by accident.
我不小心把他缩小了。

07:23.000 --> 07:24.206
Oh.
哦。

07:24.310 --> 07:25.551
And then comes a giant...
然后来了一个巨人……

07:25.655 --> 07:27.275
Wait, you don't understand!
等等，你不明白！

07:27.379 --> 07:28.275
This is serious!
这很严重！

07:28.379 --> 07:29.896
I don't know how
to un-shrink him.
我不知道怎么办
来取消他的缩小。

07:30.000 --> 07:31.482
He could be stuck like this
他可能会被困成这样

07:31.586 --> 07:32.793
for the rest of his life.
他的余生。

07:32.896 --> 07:34.793
Oh, don't worry about it.
哦，别担心。

07:34.896 --> 07:37.241
He'll find love one day.
总有一天他会找到爱情。

07:37.344 --> 07:38.241
You think so?
你这么认为吗？

07:38.344 --> 07:39.379
Sure, but it'll be
当然可以，但是会是

07:39.482 --> 07:42.172
with someone his own size.
和一个和他体型一样大的人。

07:42.275 --> 07:43.379
Like this pickle!
比如这个泡菜！

07:43.482 --> 07:44.172
See?
看？

07:44.275 --> 07:46.000
They like each other!
他们互相喜欢！

07:46.103 --> 07:47.103
No, no, no, no.
不，不，不，不。

07:49.655 --> 07:52.241
Oh, if only I knew
how to work this thing.
哦，如果我知道就好了
如何操作这个东西。

07:52.344 --> 07:53.965
Let me take a look at it.
让我看一下。

07:54.068 --> 07:55.448
Hmm...
唔...

07:55.551 --> 07:57.275
You know what the problem is?
你知道问题是什么吗？

07:57.379 --> 07:58.275
What?
什么？

07:58.379 --> 08:00.103
You got it set to "M", for mini.
你把它设置为“M”，代表迷你。

08:00.206 --> 08:02.758
When it should be set
to "W", for "wumbo."
何时应该设置
到“W”，代表“wumbo”。

08:02.862 --> 08:05.793
Patrick, I don't think
"wumbo" is a real word.
帕特里克，我不认为
“wumbo”是一个真实的词。

08:05.896 --> 08:07.241
Come on.
快点。

08:07.344 --> 08:08.344
You know:
你知道：

08:08.379 --> 08:14.448
I wumbo, you wumbo,
he-she-me wumbo.
我wumbo，你wumbo，
他-她-我wumbo。

08:14.551 --> 08:15.586
Wumbo, wumboing...
呜呜呜呜呜……

08:15.689 --> 08:17.448
I wonder if a fall
from this height
我想知道是否跌倒
从这个高度

08:17.551 --> 08:19.344
would be enough to kill me.
就足以杀了我。

08:19.448 --> 08:20.517
Wumbology?
乌姆博学？

08:20.620 --> 08:21.931
The study of wumbo?
温博的研究？

08:22.034 --> 08:24.034
It's first grade, SpongeBob!
海绵宝宝，一年级了！

08:24.137 --> 08:26.379
Patrick, I'm sorry
I doubted you.
帕特里克，对不起
我怀疑你。

08:26.482 --> 08:27.758
Well, all right, then.
好吧，那么。

08:27.862 --> 08:28.862
Let 'er rip!
让我们撕裂吧！

08:31.517 --> 08:33.758
It worked!
成功了！

08:33.862 --> 08:34.862
Oh, no!
哦，不！

08:34.896 --> 08:35.517
Look!
看！

08:35.620 --> 08:37.344
SpongeBob's giant!
海绵宝宝的巨人！

08:37.448 --> 08:38.655
Can I be giant next?
下一个我可以成为巨人吗？

08:38.758 --> 08:40.413
Patrick, I'm not giant.
帕特里克，我不是巨人。

08:40.517 --> 08:42.000
You've shrunk, too!
你也变小了！

08:42.103 --> 08:43.689
You're kidding!
你开玩笑吧！

08:43.793 --> 08:45.896
Good thing I've still
got this pickle!
还好我还有
得到这个泡菜了！

08:48.379 --> 08:51.793
Hey, now will you
take us to Mermaidman?!
嘿，现在你会吗
带我们去看美人鱼？！

08:51.896 --> 08:52.517
No!
不！

08:52.620 --> 08:53.620
He can never find out!
他永远也查不出！

08:53.689 --> 08:55.551
But I'll think of something.
但我会想到一些事情。

08:55.655 --> 08:56.827
I promise.
我保证。

08:56.931 --> 08:58.689
Until then,
you'll be safe in this jar.
直到那时，
你在这个罐子里会很安全。

08:58.793 --> 09:00.724
You know what's funny?
你知道什么好笑吗？

09:00.827 --> 09:03.896
My pickle started out in a jar,
我的泡菜是从罐子里开始的，

09:04.000 --> 09:05.517
and now it's in one again.
现在又合二为一了。

09:05.620 --> 09:08.689
Huh, it's like
a pun or something.
呵呵，就像是
双关语什么的。

09:09.758 --> 09:11.172
It's only two people.
只有两个人。

09:11.275 --> 09:12.034
No big deal.
没什么大不了的。

09:12.137 --> 09:13.344
Nobody else saw it.
没有其他人看到它。

09:13.448 --> 09:14.758
Howdy, SpongeBob!
你好，海绵宝宝！

09:14.862 --> 09:16.344
Sandy!
沙！

09:16.689 --> 09:18.241
What did you...
For cryin'...
你做了什么...
为了哭...

09:18.344 --> 09:19.655
What did ya'll do to me?
你要对我做什么？

09:19.758 --> 09:20.517
I'm sorry, Sandy!
对不起，桑迪！

09:20.620 --> 09:22.103
Mermaidman came in, and...
美人鱼进来了，然后……

09:22.206 --> 09:23.206
Hey, SpongeBob...
嘿，海绵宝宝...

09:24.206 --> 09:25.206
Hey, SpongeBob?
嘿，海绵宝宝？

09:26.275 --> 09:27.275
Hi, SpongeBob.
嗨，海绵宝宝。

09:30.068 --> 09:31.931
Hello, SpongeBob.
你好，海绵宝宝。

09:32.034 --> 09:33.241
Whoo!
呼！

09:33.344 --> 09:34.482
Sponge-Dude!
海绵哥们！

09:46.413 --> 09:48.413
Whew! I'm gonna
have to get a bigger jar.
哇！我要
必须买一个更大的罐子。

09:48.517 --> 09:51.103
SpongeBob, will you
just face facts?
海绵宝宝，你愿意吗
只面对事实？

09:51.206 --> 09:53.965
You've shrunken everybody
in Bikini Bottom.
你把所有人都缩小了
在比基尼底部。

09:54.068 --> 09:55.551
You've got to go to Mermaidman.
你一定要去看美人鱼。

09:55.655 --> 09:59.551
Oh, Squidward,
he'll be so disappointed!
哦，章鱼哥，
他会很失望的！

09:59.655 --> 10:01.931
Well, you can't
leave us small forever.
好吧，你不能
让我们永远渺小。

10:02.034 --> 10:03.655
You don't understand!
你不明白！

10:03.758 --> 10:06.000
SpongeBob...
海绵宝宝...

10:06.103 --> 10:08.344
You need to admit your mistake.
你需要承认你的错误。

10:08.448 --> 10:09.965
Mom?
妈妈？

10:10.068 --> 10:11.344
Your mother's right, son.
你妈妈是对的，儿子。

10:11.448 --> 10:12.724
Mermaidman will understand.
美人鱼会明白的。

10:12.827 --> 10:15.448
You're Mermaidman, you old coot!
你是美人鱼，你这个老笨蛋！

10:15.551 --> 10:16.310
Oh, yeah.
哦，是的。

10:16.413 --> 10:17.551
Mermaidman?
美人鱼？

10:17.655 --> 10:18.655
I'm so sorry.
我很抱歉。

10:18.724 --> 10:20.517
It's just that
I'm such a big fan,
只是这样
我真是个超级粉丝

10:20.620 --> 10:21.689
and your belt... and...
还有你的腰带……还有……

10:21.793 --> 10:23.862
Aw, don't worry, son.
噢，别担心，儿子。

10:23.965 --> 10:25.103
I understand.
我明白。

10:25.206 --> 10:27.137
Why, I remember back when
I first used the belt,
为什么，我记得那时
我第一次用的是腰带

10:27.241 --> 10:30.620
the year was nineteen,
aught, eleventy-twelve.
那年十九岁，
哦，十一点十二点。

10:30.724 --> 10:32.758
Why, I believe
the president then was...
为什么，我相信
当时的总统是...

10:32.862 --> 10:35.758
Just tell him
how to un-shrink us!
只要告诉他
如何让我们不再缩小！

10:35.862 --> 10:38.827
Oh, yes, the un-shrink ray.
哦，是的，未收缩射线。

10:38.931 --> 10:41.862
Let's see, uh... uh...
让我们看看，呃……呃……

10:41.965 --> 10:43.413
Did you set it to wumbo?
你把它设置为wumbo了吗？

10:43.517 --> 10:44.620
What?
什么？

10:48.689 --> 10:50.448
Get SpongeBob!
获取海绵宝宝！

10:56.034 --> 10:57.689
Now I have to drive five miles
现在我必须开车五英里

10:57.793 --> 10:59.172
to go to the bathroom...
去洗手间...

10:59.275 --> 11:01.034
In my own home!
在我自己家里！

11:01.379 --> 11:02.379
And I need an elevator
我需要一部电梯

11:02.448 --> 11:05.000
to climb one stair!
爬一层楼梯！

11:05.275 --> 11:07.206
We've been shrinking
我们一直在缩小

11:07.310 --> 11:08.034
for years!
多年来！

11:08.137 --> 11:10.620
But this is ridiculous.
但这是荒谬的。

11:16.000 --> 11:19.793
Everything's too big!
一切都太大了！

11:19.896 --> 11:21.000
I've got it.
我明白了。

11:25.827 --> 11:27.137
Ta-da!
哒哒！

11:27.241 --> 11:30.620
Since I couldn't make you big,
I made the city small.
既然我不能让你变得伟大，
我把城市变小了。

11:32.241 --> 11:35.172
And now only
one more thing to shrink.
而现在只有
还有一件事要缩小。

11:35.275 --> 11:36.689
Cheese!
奶酪！

11:38.827 --> 11:40.275
I guess this is okay.
我想这还可以。

11:40.379 --> 11:42.241
Yeah, what's the difference?
是啊，有什么区别？

11:42.344 --> 11:43.689
Good idea, SpongeBob.
好主意，海绵宝宝。

11:50.034 --> 11:51.896
Well, it's great to be back!
嗯，很高兴回来！

11:53.620 --> 11:55.034
Huh?
啊？

12:05.655 --> 12:08.965
Don't worry, Mrs. Puff,
this is the one.
别担心，泡芙女士，
就是这个。

12:10.103 --> 12:11.931
SpongeBob, think, think!
海绵宝宝，想一想，想一想！

12:12.034 --> 12:13.344
Turn that way, turn that way!
往这边转，往那边转！

12:13.448 --> 12:15.034
No, turn that way, left, left!
不，往那边转，左转，左转！

12:18.310 --> 12:20.068
I can do this, Mrs. Puff.
我能做到，帕芙女士。

12:20.172 --> 12:21.517
I can do it, I can do it.
我能做到，我能做到。

12:22.655 --> 12:24.724
The driving test is over,
SpongeBob!
驾照考试结束了
海绵宝宝！

12:24.827 --> 12:25.655
Stop the boat!
停船吧！

12:25.758 --> 12:27.379
Wait, I can do this, Mrs. Puff.
等等，我能做到，帕芙女士。

12:27.482 --> 12:28.172
I can do this.
我可以做到这一点。

12:28.275 --> 12:29.586
Oh!
哦！

12:29.689 --> 12:30.827
The road, SpongeBob!
路上，海绵宝宝！

12:30.931 --> 12:31.965
Get back on the road!
回到路上吧！

12:32.068 --> 12:33.793
Got to pass the test!
Got to pass!
一定要通过考试！
一定要通过！

12:35.448 --> 12:38.827
Hey! What do you got
against the melons?!
嘿！你有什么
反对瓜？！

12:38.931 --> 12:40.034
Look out!
当心！

12:40.137 --> 12:41.537
This must be
the night-driving test.
这必须是
夜间驾驶测试。

12:41.620 --> 12:43.931
We're going to straighten
you out!
我们要矫正
你出去！

12:44.034 --> 12:45.172
This'll fix you!
这会解决你的问题！

12:47.862 --> 12:48.862
Now let's get that one!
现在让我们得到那个！

12:50.241 --> 12:51.517
Barnacles!
Did you see that?
藤壶！
你看到了吗？

12:51.620 --> 12:54.724
Yeah! That guy had
no front license plate!
是的！那家伙有
没有前车牌！

12:54.827 --> 12:55.827
Let's get him.
我们来抓住他吧。

12:57.551 --> 12:58.862
Hey, look at all those police.
嘿，看看那些警察。

12:58.965 --> 13:00.758
I wonder if
the president's in town.
我想知道是否
总统在城里。

13:00.862 --> 13:02.275
Look out!
当心！

13:02.379 --> 13:03.655
It is with great pride
这是非常自豪的

13:03.758 --> 13:07.586
that I officially open
this unfinished bridge!
我正式开放
这座未完工的桥！

13:15.551 --> 13:18.275
Where did I go wrong?
我哪里做错了？

13:18.379 --> 13:21.000
With the opening
of my new boating school,
随着开幕
我的新划船学校，

13:21.103 --> 13:26.448
I pledge that as long as
a student is willing to learn,
我保证只要
一个学生愿意学习，

13:26.551 --> 13:28.310
I shall never give up.
我永远不会放弃。

13:28.413 --> 13:30.724
Hi, I'm SpongeBob SquarePants!
大家好，我是海绵宝宝！

13:37.034 --> 13:39.620
Hurry up with that truckload
of fruit punch!
Hurry up with that truckload
水果潘趣酒！

13:39.724 --> 13:41.379
The seniors are getting cranky.
前辈们越来越暴躁了。

13:45.620 --> 13:46.482
Alive!
活！

13:46.586 --> 13:47.413
I'm alive!
我还活着！

13:47.517 --> 13:49.827
Oh, thank Neptune, I'm still...
哦，谢谢海王星，我仍然...

13:57.413 --> 13:59.655
All right, seniors,
let's open these windows
好吧，前辈们，
让我们打开这些窗户

13:59.758 --> 14:02.862
so the world can see
your nice white clothes.
让世界可以看到
你漂亮的白衣服。

14:04.379 --> 14:06.413
♪ Gonna be a surfin'...
♪ 要去冲浪...

14:08.379 --> 14:09.172
♪ Surfin'
♪ 冲浪

14:09.275 --> 14:10.655
♪ Surfin', it's gonna...
♪ 冲浪，它会...

14:10.758 --> 14:13.000
It's finally finished!
终于完成了！

14:13.103 --> 14:16.793
A memoir of my life,
written in red ink.
我一生的回忆录，
用红墨水写的。

14:19.862 --> 14:22.068
Oh, barnacles!
哦，藤壶！

14:25.379 --> 14:27.413
SpongeBob, are you okay?
海绵宝宝，你还好吗？

14:27.517 --> 14:28.413
That depends.
这要看情况。

14:28.517 --> 14:29.413
Did I pass?
我通过了吗？

14:29.517 --> 14:30.413
Freeze!
冻结！

14:30.517 --> 14:32.344
You're under arrest.
你被捕了。

14:32.448 --> 14:33.137
Hold it.
握住它。

14:33.241 --> 14:34.413
You can't arrest him.
你不能逮捕他。

14:34.517 --> 14:36.310
He's just a student driver.
他只是一名学生司机。

14:36.413 --> 14:39.344
We're not talking about him.
我们不是在谈论他。

14:41.344 --> 14:43.241
But I don't belong here!
但我不属于这里！

14:43.344 --> 14:44.758
It's all a big mistake.
这都是一个大错误。

14:44.862 --> 14:47.310
Yeah, I don't belong here,
either.
是的，我不属于这里，
要么。

14:47.413 --> 14:49.310
Me, too. I'm innocent.
我也是。我是无辜的。

14:49.413 --> 14:51.448
I belong here!
我属于这里！

14:51.551 --> 14:52.931
Okay, you can do this, Puff.
好吧，你可以做到的，普夫。

14:53.034 --> 14:56.517
You can get through this
without losing your sanity.
你可以渡过这个难关
而又不会失去理智。

14:56.620 --> 14:59.965
Oh, that's a road we don't want
to go down again.
哦，那是一条我们不想要的路
再次下降。

15:00.068 --> 15:00.896
Positives!
积极的一面！

15:01.000 --> 15:02.620
Think of the positives.
想想积极的一面。

15:02.724 --> 15:03.724
Let's see...
让我们来看看...

15:03.793 --> 15:06.793
I've got no more papers
to grade.
我没有更多的文件了
来评分。

15:06.896 --> 15:07.896
Yeah!
是的！

15:08.689 --> 15:10.965
In... in fact, no more work.
事实上……没有更多的工作了。

15:11.068 --> 15:13.517
No more boating school classes.
不再有划船学校课程。

15:13.620 --> 15:14.793
No more driving.
不再开车了。

15:14.896 --> 15:16.482
No more SpongeBob!
不再有海绵宝宝了！

15:19.103 --> 15:20.551
No more phone solicitors.
不再有电话律师。

15:20.655 --> 15:21.448
No more SpongeBob.
不再有海绵宝宝了。

15:21.551 --> 15:22.931
No more company potlucks.
不再有公司聚餐了。

15:23.034 --> 15:24.034
No more SpongeBob.
不再有海绵宝宝了。

15:24.103 --> 15:25.103
No more road rage.
不再有路怒症。

15:25.206 --> 15:26.103
No more SpongeBob.
不再有海绵宝宝了。

15:26.206 --> 15:28.034
No more insurance payments.
不再需要支付保险费。

15:28.137 --> 15:29.379
No more SpongeBob.
不再有海绵宝宝了。

15:29.482 --> 15:31.724
No more SpongeBob.
不再有海绵宝宝了。

15:31.827 --> 15:32.724
No more SpongeBob!
不再有海绵宝宝了！

15:32.827 --> 15:36.068
No more SpongeBob...!!
不再有海绵宝宝了...!!

15:36.172 --> 15:41.206
I think I'm going
to likethis place.
我想我要去
喜欢这个地方。

15:41.448 --> 15:43.689
Class just isn't the same
只是班级不一样

15:43.793 --> 15:45.413
without Mrs. Puff.
没有帕夫夫人。

15:45.931 --> 15:49.413
Just the thought of her,
alone and afraid in jail...
光是想到她，
在监狱里孤独又害怕……

15:49.517 --> 15:53.827
It makes me think about her
being alone and afraid in jail.
这让我想起她
在监狱里感到孤独和恐惧。

15:53.931 --> 15:56.758
I don't know how
she's going to survive.
我不知道怎么办
她会活下去。

16:00.275 --> 16:03.275
♪ Smelling the pretty roses.
♪ 闻着美丽的玫瑰花香。

16:04.689 --> 16:07.896
♪ Happiness is just
two kinds of ice cream. ♪
♪ 幸福只是
两种冰淇淋。 ♪

16:08.000 --> 16:09.793
Oh, that poor woman.
哦，那个可怜的女人。

16:09.896 --> 16:11.241
And it's all my fault.
这都是我的错。

16:11.344 --> 16:14.172
Maybe if I go talk to Patrick,
he can ease my guilt.
也许如果我去和帕特里克谈谈
他可以减轻我的负罪感。

16:14.275 --> 16:16.827
Well, it sounds like
it's all your fault.
嗯，听起来像
都是你的错。

16:16.931 --> 16:18.034
Oh, you're right.
哦，你是对的。

16:18.137 --> 16:21.275
Mrs. Puff's in jail,
and it's all because of me.
普芙夫人入狱了
这都是因为我。

16:21.379 --> 16:23.896
I'm such a barnacle-head.
我真是个藤壶头。

16:24.000 --> 16:25.137
Poor Mrs. Puff.
可怜的普芙夫人。

16:25.241 --> 16:26.896
I know! I got to get her out.
我知道！我得把她救出来。

16:27.000 --> 16:31.379
But to get her outof jail,
first we got to get injail.
但为了让她出狱
首先我们得被监禁。

16:31.482 --> 16:33.172
How we going to do that?
我们要怎么做呢？

16:33.275 --> 16:38.586
All right, put the money
in the bag!
好吧，把钱投进去
在袋子里！

16:38.689 --> 16:39.689
Put it in!
放进去！

16:39.793 --> 16:42.862
Um, you're facing
the wrong way, sir.
嗯，你面临着
方式错误，先生。

16:43.896 --> 16:45.310
All right,
好的，

16:45.413 --> 16:46.241
give me the money!
给我钱！

16:46.344 --> 16:47.620
Will that be from your savings
这是你的积蓄吗

16:47.724 --> 16:49.551
or your checking account, sir?
或者你的支票账户，先生？

16:49.655 --> 16:50.655
Uh, savings.
呃，储蓄。

16:50.724 --> 16:52.482
May I please see
some identification?
我可以看看吗
一些身份证明？

16:52.586 --> 16:53.724
Sure. There you go.
当然。就这样吧。

16:53.827 --> 16:55.172
Thank you.
谢谢。

16:58.655 --> 17:00.172
Sir, we are showing a balance
先生，我们正在表现出平衡

17:00.275 --> 17:02.172
of zero dollars and zero cents
零美元零美分

17:02.275 --> 17:04.103
for both of your accounts.
对于您的两个帐户。

17:04.206 --> 17:05.241
Oh.
哦。

17:05.344 --> 17:06.206
Next!
下一个！

17:06.310 --> 17:07.724
That went better than expected.
这比预期的要好。

17:07.827 --> 17:12.862
Yeah, I didn't think we'd get
Mrs. Puff out of jail this fast.
是的，我没想到我们会得到
普夫夫人这么快就出狱了。

17:14.206 --> 17:18.275
Don't worry, Patrick,
we'll get into jail this time.
别担心，帕特里克，
这次我们会进监狱的。

17:19.034 --> 17:21.000
Hey, there's a couple.
嘿，有一对。

17:25.137 --> 17:28.206
Put your back in it, girls!
女孩们，把你的背部放回去吧！

17:30.758 --> 17:32.931
Look, Patrick, there she is.
看，帕特里克，她在那儿。

17:35.413 --> 17:36.724
Mrs. Puff, wait!
泡芙太太，等等！

17:36.827 --> 17:39.310
It's us... SpongeBob and Patrick.
是我们……海绵宝宝和帕特里克。

17:39.413 --> 17:40.758
That's funny.
那很好笑。

17:40.862 --> 17:43.689
For a second, I thought
that yellow rock talked to me,
有那么一瞬间，我想
那块黄色的岩石对我说话，

17:43.793 --> 17:45.689
and its voice
sounded a lot like...
和它的声音
听起来很像……

17:45.793 --> 17:48.310
SpongeBob.
It's me, SpongeBob.
海绵宝宝。
是我，海绵宝宝。

17:49.586 --> 17:51.172
We're going to bust you
out of here.
我们要打败你
离开这里。

17:51.275 --> 17:52.379
Come on, Mrs. Puff!
来吧，泡芙夫人！

17:52.482 --> 17:53.344
It's you!
是你！

17:53.448 --> 17:54.551
What are you doing here?
你在这里做什么？

17:54.655 --> 17:56.965
Why did you follow me in here?
你为什么跟着我来这里？

17:57.068 --> 17:57.862
Why?
为什么？

17:57.965 --> 17:59.068
All right,
Mrs. Puff.
好吧，
泡芙女士。

17:59.172 --> 18:01.068
It looks like
this heat's gone
to your head.
看起来像
这热气消失了
到你的头上。

18:01.172 --> 18:02.758
If you're going to talk
to rocks,
如果你要说话
到岩石，

18:02.862 --> 18:05.689
it's time for you
to go on kitchen duty.
你的时间到了
去厨房值班。

18:05.793 --> 18:06.551
Yes!
是的！

18:06.655 --> 18:08.965
It... it must be the heat.
这……一定是天气太热了。

18:09.068 --> 18:09.931
Yes!
是的！

18:10.034 --> 18:11.034
Darn it!
该死的！

18:11.068 --> 18:12.896
Okay, Patrick,
let's get out of here!
好吧，帕特里克，
我们离开这里吧！

18:13.000 --> 18:14.517
No, wait!
不，等等！

18:14.620 --> 18:18.655
There goes our deposit
on these costumes.
我们的押金就这样没了
在这些服装上。

18:21.344 --> 18:23.000
There you are!
你在那里！

18:23.103 --> 18:24.206
Hey there, Puff Mama!
嘿，泡芙妈妈！

18:24.310 --> 18:25.586
What's today's grub?
今天的菜是什么？

18:25.689 --> 18:26.482
Hi, Donna.
嗨，唐娜。

18:26.586 --> 18:28.620
It's chili, same as always.
和往常一样，还是辣椒。

18:28.724 --> 18:31.034
Let me get you some.
让我给你拿一些。

18:32.896 --> 18:33.931
Mrs. Puff,
泡芙女士，

18:34.034 --> 18:36.103
it's me, SpongeBob.
是我，海绵宝宝。

18:36.206 --> 18:40.586
When are these horrific
hallucinations going to end?
什么时候有这些可怕的事
幻觉会结束吗？

18:40.689 --> 18:42.275
No, it's really me!
不，真的是我！

18:42.379 --> 18:44.310
I brought Patrick along, too!
我也把帕特里克也带来了！

18:44.413 --> 18:45.241
Hi.
你好。

18:45.344 --> 18:46.344
Why?!
为什么？！

18:46.413 --> 18:48.379
Because we're going
to set you free!
因为我们要去
让你自由！

18:48.482 --> 18:50.620
No, I mean, why'd you bring him?
不，我是说，你为什么带他来？

18:52.689 --> 18:53.689
He likes chili.
他喜欢辣椒。

18:53.793 --> 18:55.344
Now, quick, get in
before someone sees!
现在，快点，进去吧
在有人看到之前！

18:55.448 --> 18:58.206
SpongeBob, I am not
going with you.
海绵宝宝，我不是
和你一起去。

18:58.310 --> 19:00.931
That's a good one,
Mrs. Puff.
这是一个很好的，
泡芙女士。

19:01.034 --> 19:01.896
Now hop in, come on.
现在跳进去，来吧。

19:02.000 --> 19:03.586
SpongeBob, I think she means it.
海绵宝宝，我想她是认真的。

19:03.689 --> 19:05.137
Oh, that's crazy, Patrick.
哦，那太疯狂了，帕特里克。

19:05.241 --> 19:06.517
He's right, SpongeBob.
他是对的，海绵宝宝。

19:06.620 --> 19:07.620
I'm staying.
我留下来。

19:07.655 --> 19:08.793
But why?
但为什么？

19:08.896 --> 19:10.413
I like it here.
我喜欢这里。

19:10.517 --> 19:13.172
These are my people.
这些是我的人。

19:14.206 --> 19:15.517
And besides, if I'm in here,
另外，如果我在这里的话

19:15.620 --> 19:18.586
that means I won't have to deal
with you... you...
这意味着我不必处理
和你...你...

19:21.482 --> 19:24.551
Uranium in the water supply!
供水系统中含有铀！

19:24.655 --> 19:26.448
See? Crystal clear.
看？晶莹剔透。

19:27.724 --> 19:28.862
Ah.
啊。

19:28.965 --> 19:31.000
Excuse us just
one second, Mrs. Puff.
请原谅我们
等一下，普夫夫人。

19:31.103 --> 19:32.241
Patrick, she has lost it!
帕特里克，她已经迷失了！

19:32.344 --> 19:33.862
She's completely
institutionalized.
她完全是
制度化。

19:33.965 --> 19:37.413
She's forgotten what
it's like to live
on the outside...
她忘记了什么
就像活着
在外面...

19:37.517 --> 19:38.517
To not be in prison.
为了不进监狱。

19:41.586 --> 19:44.000
Coming to bed, honey?
亲爱的，要睡觉了吗？

19:44.103 --> 19:45.413
Yes, dear.
是的亲爱的。

19:45.517 --> 19:48.034
We've got to remind
her there is life
other than this.
我们必须提醒
她有生命
除此之外。

19:48.137 --> 19:49.482
Mrs. Puff,
if you come with us,
泡芙女士，
如果你和我们一起去

19:49.586 --> 19:52.965
I'll stay after
school and decorate
the whole classroom!
之后我会留下来
学校和装饰
整个教室！

19:53.068 --> 19:54.448
For the last time, no!
最后一次，不！

19:54.551 --> 19:56.551
I'm not going with you.
我不会和你一起去。

19:56.655 --> 19:57.758
That's final!
这就是最终的结果！

19:57.862 --> 19:58.965
Oh!
哦！

20:00.275 --> 20:04.137
Talking to inanimate objects
again, eh, Puff?
与无生命的物体交谈
又来了，嗯，泡芙？

20:04.241 --> 20:05.241
Get back to your cell.
回到你的牢房。

20:05.310 --> 20:08.448
No more kitchen time for you.
你不再有厨房时间了。

20:15.620 --> 20:16.724
Quick, Mrs. Puff,
hop on.
快点，帕夫夫人，
跳上来。

20:16.827 --> 20:18.931
Guards! Guards!
Come quick!
卫兵！卫兵！
快来吧！

20:19.034 --> 20:20.620
There's a crazed
ex-student of mine
有一个疯狂的
我以前的学生

20:20.724 --> 20:23.586
and his overweight
friend here
to break me out!
和他超重的
朋友在这里
让我出去！

20:23.689 --> 20:25.103
That's just raw material
这只是原材料

20:25.206 --> 20:26.931
used to make coat hangers.
用于制作衣架。

20:27.034 --> 20:28.517
You need some rest.
你需要休息一下。

20:32.655 --> 20:33.655
Psst!
嘘！

20:34.000 --> 20:35.103
Hop in, Mrs. Puff.
上车吧，普芙夫人。

20:35.206 --> 20:38.103
Guards! Guards!
Come look.
卫兵！卫兵！
过来看看。

20:40.172 --> 20:41.172
Whoa!
哇！

20:41.241 --> 20:44.344
They don't pay me enough
to do this job.
他们付给我的钱不够
来做这项工作。

20:45.793 --> 20:47.413
Mrs. Puff, up here!
普芙女士，上来！

20:47.517 --> 20:48.896
Guards!
卫兵！

20:49.000 --> 20:51.068
Guards! They're back!
卫兵！他们回来了！

20:51.172 --> 20:52.896
What's all the hubbub, Puff?
到底是怎么回事啊，泡芙？

20:53.000 --> 20:54.551
They're back!
他们回来了！

20:54.655 --> 20:57.758
Mrs. Puff, it's us!
泡芙女士，是我们！

21:03.793 --> 21:06.862
What the barnacle is going on?
藤壶这是怎么回事？

21:06.965 --> 21:08.586
Get away from me!
离我远点！

21:08.689 --> 21:09.586
Get away!
逃离！

21:09.689 --> 21:11.413
What are you talking
about, Puff?
你在说什么
关于，普夫？

21:11.517 --> 21:12.689
You can't fool me.
你骗不了我的。

21:12.793 --> 21:16.413
You're SpongeBob
and that guy who
likes the chili.
你是海绵宝宝
和那个人
喜欢辣椒。

21:17.448 --> 21:21.620
Let's face it, Puff,
you've gone off
the deep end.
让我们面对现实吧，泡芙，
你走了
深渊。

21:22.620 --> 21:23.862
Get in there, you!
进来吧，你！

21:23.965 --> 21:29.103
You need a nice long stay
in solitary confinement!
你需要一个愉快的长期住宿
单独监禁！

21:29.206 --> 21:30.517
Oh, well...
那好吧...

21:30.620 --> 21:33.586
Let's look
at the positives again.
让我们看看
再次看到积极的一面。

21:33.689 --> 21:35.724
I'm finally away from those two.
我终于远离那两个人了

21:35.827 --> 21:40.724
Yes, all alone
in my nice soft room.
是的，独自一人
在我漂亮柔软的房间里。

21:40.827 --> 21:43.068
Made of sponge.
由海绵制成。

21:54.034 --> 21:56.137
I can pass the test,
Mrs. Puff!
我能通过考试
泡芙太太！

21:56.241 --> 21:57.448
I can pass the test!
我能通过考试！

22:08.379 --> 22:09.448
Freeze!
冻结！

22:09.551 --> 22:11.551
Your joyride's over, punk!
你的欢乐之旅结束了，朋克！

22:11.655 --> 22:13.862
No!
不！

22:13.965 --> 22:14.586
What?
什么？

22:14.689 --> 22:15.448
No, no!
不，不！

22:15.551 --> 22:16.689
What are you doing?
你在干什么？

22:16.793 --> 22:17.413
Help! Help!
帮助！帮助！

22:17.517 --> 22:18.275
No! No! Please!
不！不！请！

22:18.379 --> 22:19.620
I have a snail to feed.
我有一只蜗牛要喂。

22:19.724 --> 22:20.896
I can't go to jail now.
我现在不能进监狱。

22:21.000 --> 22:22.034
This is not a good time.
现在不是一个好时机。

22:22.137 --> 22:24.517
No, please, please,
I'm not a criminal!
不，拜托，拜托，
我不是罪犯！

22:24.620 --> 22:25.965
I can't believe it.
我简直不敢相信。

22:26.068 --> 22:27.068
It was all a dream.
这一切都是一场梦。

22:27.172 --> 22:29.482
I'm not going to jail!
我不会进监狱的！

22:29.586 --> 22:31.310
Why would you go to jail?
你为什么要进监狱？

22:31.413 --> 22:34.034
You already did your time.
你已经尽了你的时间。

22:39.655 --> 22:40.758
Huh?
啊？

22:40.862 --> 22:43.275
Oh, it's just
my imagination again.
哦，这只是
又是我的想象。

22:43.379 --> 22:46.448
So what's for dinner
tonight, Puff Mama,
chili?
那么晚餐吃什么
今晚，泡芙妈妈，
辣椒？

22:54.068 --> 23:01.551
Aw, forget it.
噢，算了。

23:01.655 --> 23:04.310
And NICKELODEON
还有尼克罗迪恩

